"other event listings. If unset, the platform falls back to displaying the "
"event header image, then the event logo, and finally a default calendar "
"placeholder icon. It should be optimized for a rectangular card. We "
"recommend an aspect ratio of 16:9, and at least 800 x 450 px for best "
"display results."
